# Kept out of what the browser-node image's build is sent: .git, .venv*, the host's node_modules (the image runs
# npm ci itself), __pycache__, data and .env* files. The image copies package.json, package-lock.json,
# policies/, entrypoint.sh, server.mjs, sandbox.mjs, sandbox-report.mjs and novnc_origin.py.
.git
**/.venv*
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
data
**/.env*
